// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`workspace examples > opens localized examples only on request (en) 1`] = `"Use these examples to describe your ideaWhen a request needs more detail, AI asks about its purpose, style and other choices in chat. These examples show ways to describe video creation.Describe the goal and plan the shotsTell AI the subject, total duration and style, such as “a 40-second product film”.Generate within the model’s clip limitLonger videos use several clips with consistent subjects, scenes and style. Each clip follows the selected model’s duration limit.Trim and join the complete videoClips are joined in order and trimmed to the requested duration. You can also join or trim videos you already have.Try askingCreate a 40-second product filmJoin the first 5 seconds of each uploaded videoExamples only fill the composer. Edit before sending; inserting an example starts no generation and incurs no charge.Close examples"`;

exports[`workspace examples > opens localized examples only on request (zh) 1`] = `"参考这些示例，描述你的想法请求不够明确时，AI 会在聊天中询问用途、风格等细节。这里的示例可帮助你了解视频创作的表达方式说清目标，先安排分镜告诉 AI 主题、总时长与风格，例如“一支 40 秒的产品短片”按模型时长，分段生成较长视频会拆成多段，保持人物、场景与风格连贯；单段时长以所用模型为准自动剪辑，合成完整视频生成后按顺序拼接，并按目标时长裁剪；已有视频也可以直接拼接或裁剪试着这样说制作一支 40 秒的产品短片把上传的视频各取前 5 秒，按顺序拼接点示例只会填入输入框，可修改后再发送；填入不会开始生成或产生费用关闭示例"`;
